    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d288">

                <pb facs="0524" n="462" sameAs="frus:frus1878/pg462"/>

                <head>No. 283.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Wurts to Mr. Evarts</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Rome</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1877-09-18"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">September</hi> 18, 1877</date>. (Received
                        October 8.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 700.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my dispatch No. 699, of the
                    16th instant, I inclose to you herewith a copy and translation of a note from
                    the Italian ministry of foreign affairs, by which the Government of the King
                    signfies to the Government of the United States its formal intention to
                    terminate on the 17th of September, 1878, the consular convention now existing
                    between the two countries.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>GEORGE W. WURTS.</signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d288-a1.xml" xpointer="d288-a1"/>
            </div>
